# Files irrelevant (or harmful) to the Docker build context.  Smaller
# context = faster `COPY .` + faster cache invalidation analysis.
#
# Notable: `.git/` is excluded so the lint stage's gitleaks step
# auto-falls into `detect --source=. --no-git` mode (scan tree)
# instead of `protect --staged` mode (scan diff); shipping git
# history inside the production image is also a leak risk on its own.

.git/
.github/
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store

# Local-only artefacts.
bin/
out/

# Editor / OS noise.
*.swp
*~

# Local environment overrides — must never go into the image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Tests and CI config don't run in production.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
